package Libraries.Game.Graphics.Models

use Libraries.Game.Graphics.Color

/*This class is an interface for storing resources used by an individual model, depending on the rendering system used.
Unlike ModelBlueprint, which stores information that is common across multiple models, this class holds information for
a specific, individual Item3D-type model.

Actual resources are held by implementing classes like ModelResourcesOpenGL or ModelResourcesVulkan.*/
class ModelResources

    /*
    This action sets the diffuse color of a primitive model. If the model did not
    previously have a color applied to it, it will add a color to it.
    */
    blueprint action SetColor(Color color)

end